msgstr "Commande introuvable."

#: includes/admin-charges.php:307
msgid "Ordered"
msgstr "Commandé"

#: includes/admin-charges.php:294
msgid "Orders that have not shipped have no date yet — their delay starts when the order is marked Completed."
msgstr "Les commandes non expédiées n’ont pas encore de date : leur délai démarre au passage en Terminée."

#: includes/admin-charges.php:687 includes/admin-charges.php:858 includes/admin-charges.php:960
