msgstr "Résultat : la passerelle est proposée à ce client"

#: includes/gateway.php:56
msgid "Reuses the SEPA mandate the customer already has saved at Stripe. Nothing is charged at checkout: the charge is sent automatically a configurable number of days after the order is marked Completed. The delay is set below and can be overridden per customer on their user profile."
msgstr "Réutilise le mandat SEPA que le client a déjà enregistré chez Stripe. Rien n’est prélevé lors de la commande : le prélèvement part automatiquement un nombre de jours configurable après le passage de la commande en Terminée. Le délai se règle ci-dessous et peut être redéfini pour chaque client sur son profil."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:86
msgid "Role allowed"
msgstr "Rôle autorisé"

#: includes/gateway.php:65 includes/gateway.php:89
msgid "SEPA Direct Debit (deferred)"
msgstr "Prélèvement SEPA (différé)"

#: includes/admin-charges.php:40 includes/admin-charges.php:41 includes/admin-charges.php:143
msgid "SEPA charges"
msgstr "Prélèvements SEPA"

#: includes/order-screen.php:192
msgid "Sends the charge immediately instead of waiting for the due date. The scheduled action stays in place but will do nothing: the order is marked as charged, and the idempotency key rules out a second debit."
msgstr "Envoie le prélèvement immédiatement au lieu d’attendre l’échéance. L’action planifiée reste en place mais ne fera rien : la commande est marquée comme prélevée, et la clé d’idempotence exclut un second débit."

#: includes/admin-charges.php:686 includes/admin-charges.php:959
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Envoyé"

#: dahu-deferred-sepa.php:300
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Réglages"

#: includes/admin-charges.php:311
msgid "Settled (estimate)"
msgstr "Encaissé (estimation)"

#: includes/gateway.php:157
msgid "Show administrators why the gateway is or is not available"
msgstr "Montrer aux administrateurs pourquoi la passerelle est disponible ou non"

#: includes/gateway.php:129
msgid "Shown to customers as the address to write to about a mandate change. Empty falls back to the site admin address."
msgstr "Affichée aux clients comme l’adresse à qui écrire pour changer de mandat. Vide, l’adresse d’administration du site est employée."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:199
msgid "Signed in as"
msgstr "Connecté en tant que"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:130
msgid "Stripe customer resolved"
msgstr "Client Stripe identifié"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:169
msgid "Stripe identifiers on this order"
msgstr "Identifiants Stripe de cette commande"

#: includes/gateway.php:134
msgid "Stripe keys"
msgstr "Clés Stripe"

#: includes/stripe.php:161
msgid "Stripe returned a response that could not be read."
msgstr "Stripe a renvoyé une réponse illisible."

#: includes/checkout.php:201
msgid "Stripe's own SEPA Direct Debit charges immediately and cannot be set on an order here. Use Deferred SEPA Direct Debit instead. The payment method was left as it was."
msgstr "Le prélèvement SEPA natif de Stripe prélève immédiatement et ne peut pas être posé sur une commande ici. Employez le prélèvement SEPA différé. Le moyen de paiement a été laissé tel quel."

#: includes/gateway.php:113
msgid "Stripe's own SEPA option"
msgstr "L’option SEPA native de Stripe"

#: includes/mandates.php:601
msgid "Submit for approval"
msgstr "Soumettre pour approbation"

#: includes/gateway.php:139
msgid "Test mode"
msgstr "Mode test"

#: includes/gateway.php:150
msgid "Test secret key"
msgstr "Clé secrète de test"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:98
msgid "That mandate still exists"
msgstr "Ce mandat existe toujours"

#. translators: %s: time of day, already formatted. */
#: includes/order-screen.php:149
msgid "The charge is sent at %s on the chosen day. SEPA then settles in a few working days. Leave the field as it is to change nothing, and save the order to apply."
msgstr "Le prélèvement part à %s le jour choisi. L’encaissement SEPA suit en quelques jours ouvrés. Laissez le champ tel quel pour ne rien changer, et enregistrez la commande pour appliquer."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:106
msgid "The customer has it as their own default"
msgstr "Le client l’a bien en moyen de paiement par défaut"

#: includes/gateway.php:116
msgid "The official Stripe plugin's SEPA Direct Debit charges immediately. Hiding it at checkout stops it being picked as a competing option, while leaving it available under My account → Payment methods, which is where the customer signs the mandate in the first place."
msgstr "Le prélèvement SEPA de l’extension Stripe officielle prélève immédiatement. Le masquer lors de la commande l’empêche d’être choisi comme option concurrente, tout en le laissant disponible sous Mon compte → Moyens de paiement, où le client signe le mandat au départ."

#. translators: %d: assumed settlement time in working days. */
#: includes/admin-charges.php:289
msgid "The settlement date is an estimate: it assumes %d working days after the charge is sent, which WooCommerce cannot verify."
